&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;107&quot; data-end=&quot;126&quot;&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;127&quot; data-end=&quot;406&quot;&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;408&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Romandie office (Geneva/Lausanne) is at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;821&quot;&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;822&quot; data-end=&quot;1096&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;879&quot;&gt;Senior Technical Consultant / Senior AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the design and delivery of impactful AI and data solutions. You’ll combine hands-on engineering with client advisory, guiding multi-disciplinary teams from opportunity framing to production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1098&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1098&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;Own solution architecture &amp;amp; delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Define end-to-end architectures (data, ML/LLM, APIs, security), make build/buy decisions, and drive projects from PoC to production with reliability, observability, and cost in mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1327&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1329&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1329&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Lead complex PoCs &amp;amp; pilots:&lt;/strong&gt; Scope, prototype, and validate AI/ML use cases (incl. LLMs/GenAI, RAG, fine-tuning, evaluation) and convert successful pilots into scalable products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1513&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1551&quot;&gt;Advanced programming &amp;amp; modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, adapt, and evaluate ML/DL/LLM models using Python (PyTorch, TensorFlow, HuggingFace, LangChain/LlamaIndex), including prompt engineering, fine-tuning/LoRA, vector search, and safety/guardrails.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1755&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; MLOps/LLMOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and operate solutions on Azure, GCP, or AWS (CI/CD, containers, model serving, feature stores, vector DBs, monitoring, eval pipelines).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1928&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1930&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1930&quot; data-end=&quot;1975&quot;&gt;Client advisory &amp;amp; stakeholder management:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate business goals into technical roadmaps, present to senior stakeholders, manage risks and trade-offs, and ensure measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2128&quot; data-end=&quot;2265&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2265&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2165&quot;&gt;Quality, security &amp;amp; governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Enforce best practices on data privacy, model risk management, responsible AI, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2266&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2268&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2268&quot; data-end=&quot;2300&quot;&gt;Team leadership &amp;amp; mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach engineers/consultants, perform code and design reviews, and help shape delivery standards and reusable accelerators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2426&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2463&quot;&gt;Pre-sales &amp;amp; thought leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Support proposals, estimates, and statements of work; contribute to assets, talks, and publications that advance Artefact’s AI offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2602&quot; data-end=&quot;2622&quot;&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2623&quot; data-end=&quot;2715&quot;&gt;Engineer first, consultant second — with a builder’s mindset and a track record of shipping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2717&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2717&quot; data-end=&quot;2874&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2719&quot; data-end=&quot;2874&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2719&quot; data-end=&quot;2734&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5–8+ years in data/ML/AI engineering or adjacent roles, including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2801&quot; data-end=&quot;2849&quot;&gt;end-to-end delivery of production AI systems&lt;/strong&gt; (not just prototypes).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2875&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2877&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2877&quot; data-end=&quot;2893&quot;&gt;Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert Python; solid software engineering (testing, packaging, CI/CD). SQL required; Java/Scala/TypeScript a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3011&quot; data-end=&quot;3145&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3013&quot; data-end=&quot;3145&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3013&quot; data-end=&quot;3023&quot;&gt;AI/ML:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on with ML/DL and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3048&quot; data-end=&quot;3056&quot;&gt;LLMs&lt;/strong&gt; (prompting, fine-tuning/LoRA, embeddings/RAG, evaluation &amp;amp; observability, guardrails).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3146&quot; data-end=&quot;3266&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3148&quot; data-end=&quot;3266&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3148&quot; data-end=&quot;3158&quot;&gt;Cloud:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3178&quot; data-end=&quot;3194&quot;&gt;at least one&lt;/strong&gt; major cloud (Azure, GCP, or AWS) deploying secure, scalable services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3267&quot; data-end=&quot;3504&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3269&quot; data-end=&quot;3504&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3269&quot; data-end=&quot;3286&quot;&gt;MLOps/LLMOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Containers (Docker/Kubernetes), Git, pipelines (e.g., GitHub Actions/Cloud-native), model serving (FastAPI/TorchServe/Triton), experiment tracking, model registry, vector DBs (FAISS, Pinecone, pgvector, OpenSearch).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3505&quot; data-end=&quot;3640&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3507&quot; data-end=&quot;3640&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3507&quot; data-end=&quot;3531&quot;&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; data:&lt;/strong&gt; Designing data/ML platforms, APIs, microservices; familiarity with data pipelines and streaming is valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3641&quot; data-end=&quot;3761&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3643&quot; data-end=&quot;3761&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3643&quot; data-end=&quot;3665&quot;&gt;Consulting skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Requirements gathering, storytelling, senior stakeholder management, and clear documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3762&quot; data-end=&quot;3876&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3764&quot; data-end=&quot;3876&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3764&quot; data-end=&quot;3778&quot;&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3779&quot; data-end=&quot;3812&quot;&gt;Fluency in French and English&lt;/strong&gt; (written &amp;amp; spoken) is mandatory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3877&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3879&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3879&quot; data-end=&quot;3900&quot;&gt;Work eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3947&quot; data-end=&quot;3963&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3947&quot; data-end=&quot;3963&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3964&quot; data-end=&quot;4225&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3964&quot; data-end=&quot;4062&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3966&quot; data-end=&quot;4062&quot;&gt;Experience with responsible AI/governance frameworks, security reviews, and cost optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4063&quot; data-end=&quot;4158&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4065&quot; data-end=&quot;4158&quot;&gt;Domain experience in one or more industries (e.g., retail, pharma, manufacturing, finance).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4159&quot; data-end=&quot;4225&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4161&quot; data-end=&quot;4225&quot;&gt;Contributions to open-source, publications, or conference talks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;4227&quot; data-end=&quot;4241&quot;&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4242&quot; data-end=&quot;4752&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4242&quot; data-end=&quot;4359&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4244&quot; data-end=&quot;4359&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4244&quot; data-end=&quot;4274&quot;&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate at the intersection of boardroom strategy and cutting-edge AI engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4360&quot; data-end=&quot;4494&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4362&quot; data-end=&quot;4494&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4362&quot; data-end=&quot;4389&quot;&gt;Romandie Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; High visibility from day one; help shape our Swiss footprint and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4495&quot; data-end=&quot;4630&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4497&quot; data-end=&quot;4630&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4497&quot; data-end=&quot;4519&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced training across strategy, AI/ML/LLM, and cloud; international missions and communities of practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4631&quot; data-end=&quot;4752&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4633&quot; data-end=&quot;4752&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4633&quot; data-end=&quot;4654&quot;&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovation, action, collaboration. We move fast, deliver impact, and support each other’s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4754&quot; data-end=&quot;4796&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4754&quot; data-end=&quot;4767&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Lausanne / Geneva (Romandie)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4798&quot; data-end=&quot;4942&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the criteria, we still want to hear from you. Passion, curiosity, and impact orientation matter — tell us about yours.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

